### สร้างออเดอร์
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: key-001

{"gameUid":"123456789","product":"Diamond 100","amount":99}

### ไม่ใส่ Idempotency-Key (ควรได้ 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"gameUid":"123456789","product":"Diamond 100","amount":99}


### ปัจจุบัน 
GET "http://localhost:8080/orders?tab=current"

### ประวัติ
GET "http://localhost:8080/orders?tab=history"


### พบออเดอร์ → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/ORD-1793546033904-165

### format ผิด → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/abc

### format ถูกแต่ไม่มีในระบบ → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/ORD-1111111111111-111


### current หน้า 1
GET http://localhost:8080/orders?tab=current&page=1

### current หน้า 2
GET http://localhost:8080/orders?tab=current&page=2

### history
GET http://localhost:8080/orders?tab=history

### tab ผิด → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/orders?tab=abc

### page ผิด → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/orders?page=0

### timeline → 200 (ใส่ orderNo จริงจาก Step 3)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/ORD-1793546033904-165/timeline

### timeline ไม่พบ → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/ORD-1111111111111-111/timeline


### bot-1 บันทึกการจ่าย → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/orders/ORD-1793546033904-165/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{"botId":"bot-1"}

### ส่งซ้ำ → 409 DUPLICATE_PAYMENT
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/orders/ORD-1793546033904-165/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{"botId":"bot-1"}

### ออเดอร์ที่ไม่ใช่ IN_PROGRESS → 409 NOT_CLAIMED
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/orders/ORD-1700000000002-002/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{"botId":"bot-1"}

### ไม่มีออเดอร์ → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/orders/ORD-1111111111111-111/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{"botId":"bot-1"}


Send-Webhook '{"eventId":"evt-1","orderNo":"ORD-A","type":"payment.succeeded"}'   # → queued
Send-Webhook '{"eventId":"evt-1","orderNo":"ORD-A","type":"payment.succeeded"}'   # → duplicate
Send-Webhook '{"eventId":"evt-3","orderNo":"ORD-A","type":"payment.succeeded"}'   # → ignored + alert
Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Uri http://localhost:8080/webhooks/bank -Headers @{"X-Signature"="deadbeef"} -ContentType "application/json" -Body '{}'   # → 401